    {
      "title": "The Results",
      "content": "The application of RFT to MLLMs has achieved significant successes in various areas, including <strong>diverse modalities</strong>, <strong>diverse tasks and domains</strong>, <strong>better training algorithms</strong>, <strong>abundant benchmarks</strong>, and <strong>thriving engineering frameworks</strong>. These successes demonstrate the potential of RFT in enhancing the reasoning capabilities of MLLMs and paving the way for future research in this area.",
