    {
      "title": "Why It Matters",
      "content": "The research on RFT for MLLMs has significant implications for the development of artificial general intelligence (AGI). <strong>Enhancing the reasoning capabilities of MLLMs</strong> can lead to more intelligent and capable models that can perform a wide range of tasks, from language understanding to decision-making. Furthermore, the development of more advanced training algorithms and benchmarks can facilitate the creation of more robust and generalizable models.",
