    {
      "title": "Future Directions",
      "content": "The future of RFT research for MLLMs is promising, with several potential directions for exploration. These include <strong>achieving better generalization across modalities, tasks, and domains</strong>, <strong>combining the outcome reward paradigm and the process reward paradigm</strong>, <strong>paying more attention to the safety of reasoning MLLMs</strong>, <strong>investigating more data augmentation attempts for multimodality</strong>, and <strong>exploring better algorithms, reward paradigms, and beyond</strong>.",
